# Play test of Bearback Isle (CIPlay bearback_isle, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the cave on the north beach, the
# bear in it, the hoard's chest, the treasure. Points as in its recipe.
island Bearback Isle
offset 0 0
expect animals Bear 1
wait 3
kill Bear
# In from the north beach along the cave's passage to the hoard
walk -1 20 to -1 15 to -1 11 h=2.1 below=3
expect stand -1 12 h=2 below=3
open Hoard in the bear's cave
dig
